msgid "WebRTC automatically adjusts the resolution and framerate based on network conditions."
msgstr "WebRTC otomatik olarak ağ koşullarına dayanan karar ve çerçeveyi ayarlar."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_file_transfer.html.heex:18
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "When you receive an offer, you see the file name and size. Click"
msgstr "Bir teklif aldığınızda, dosyayı ve boyutunu görüyorsunuz. Click Click Click Click Click"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_file_transfer.html.heex:11
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "and select the file."
msgstr "Dosyayı seçin."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_audio_call.html.heex:14
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "button to mute your microphone. The other user will see an indication that you are muted."
msgstr "Mikrofonunuzu muteyemek için düğme. Diğer kullanıcı, çamur olduğunuzun bir göstergesidir."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_audio_call.html.heex:22
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "to finish. Both users return to the lobby."
msgstr "bitirmek için. Her iki kullanıcı da lobiye geri döndü."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_video_call.html.heex:24
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "to pause the video. The peer will see a placeholder."
msgstr "Videoyu durdurmak için. Eş bir yer sahibi görecek."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_video_call.html.heex:32
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "to pop the remote video into a floating window that stays visible while navigating other tabs."
msgstr "Uzak videoyu diğer sekmeleri atlarken görünür görünen bir pencereye pop."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_media_devices.html.heex:5
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "to see available devices. Choose a microphone, camera, or audio output from the menus."
msgstr "Mevcut cihazlar görmek için. Bir mikrofon, kamera veya menülerden ses çıktı seçin."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_universal_lobby.html.heex:37
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "/p2p"
msgstr "/p2p"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_universal_lobby.html.heex:9
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A persistent dock exposes every feature: Audio, Video, File and Game. Each feature opens its own panel, and panels stack so several activities can run together."
msgstr "A persistent dock exposes every feature: Audio, Video, File and Game. Each feature opens its own panel, and panels stack so several activities can run together."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_universal_lobby.html.heex:16
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Audio and video are self-controlled: each peer turns their own microphone and camera on or off independently, like a modern video call. There is no separate consent to start a call."
msgstr "Audio and video are self-controlled: each peer turns their own microphone and camera on or off independently, like a modern video call. There is no separate consent to start a call."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_network_stats.html.heex:61
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Connection Diagram"
msgstr "Connection Diagram"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_network_stats.html.heex:38
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Download / Upload"
msgstr "Download / Upload"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_network_stats.html.heex:2
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "During a call the Network panel shows live statistics about your peer-to-peer connection. Click the ? button in the panel to see a short explanation of each metric inline, or hover any row for a tooltip."
msgstr "During a call the Network panel shows live statistics about your peer-to-peer connection. Click the ? button in the panel to see a short explanation of each metric inline, or hover any row for a tooltip."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_universal_lobby.html.heex:30
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Ending any one activity — hanging up a call, finishing a transfer, closing a game — keeps the lobby open for the next thing. The connection only closes when someone leaves or the lobby goes idle."
msgstr "Ending any one activity — hanging up a call, finishing a transfer, closing a game — keeps the lobby open for the next thing. The connection only closes when someone leaves or the lobby goes idle."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_universal_lobby.html.heex:23
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "File transfers and games still ask the other side to accept. Send a file at any time — even during a call — and the receiver confirms. Propose a game from the picker; once accepted it runs on the same connection alongside your call and transfers."
msgstr "File transfers and games still ask the other side to accept. Send a file at any time — even during a call — and the receiver confirms. Propose a game from the picker; once accepted it runs on the same connection alongside your call and transfers."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_universal_lobby.html.heex:21
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
